 advance its economic, technological, and scientific goals.\r\n\r\nExamples: \r\n\r\n"Вопросы и Ответы по школьной физике" (Questions and Answers on School Physics) \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"Решение основных задач физики" (Problems in General Physics) by I.E. Irodov\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n"Уличные бои" (Street Fighting) by Petrov (1942)'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 858, 'usage.prompt_tokens': 754})
